  "Where avoidable points are often lost in hard demo reviews. Mathematics usually leads, then economics, then English.": "Wo in harten Demo-Reviews oft vermeidbare Punkte verloren gehen. Meist führt Mathematik, dann Economics, dann English.",
  "If a question feels unfair rather than simply hard, tell us which one. Clear feedback helps us improve the bank.": "Wenn eine Frage unfair wirkt statt nur schwer, sag uns welche. Klares Feedback hilft uns, die Bank zu verbessern.",
